      "writtenOn": "2017-02-09T17:47:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not clear to me whether the callback contains the exact same proxy object or not. We cannot compare 2 proxy objects pointing to the same remote object yet, b/33818800 for this  was marked \"Wont Fix\".\n\nI had some done digging around the death notification handling (go/aog/332126) and I do think they\u0027re the same, but I was told to use the cookie to lookup the dead client: https://buganizer.corp.google.com/issues/33818800#comment9.\n\nSo, in summary, this might be redundant, but I don\u0027t think there is any harm in using the cookie.",
